      "writtenOn": "2025-02-19T19:58:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Debugfs isn\u0027t supposed to be mounted on user builds, which I think we want. I\u0027m not aware of a `/proc` file for ashmem, but if we did want to use procfs for this, would you suggest implementing these knobs as sysctls?",
      "parentUuid": "1cb8af3a_c0842188",
      "revId": "a5a0a60517448e3709f33dbf4c3e15a5cf3d246d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
